  "description": "...Wudang Has Fallen!!! After a long mission, the second disciple, Chung-yeop, returns home--only to find the main sect in ruins. Stricken with despair, Chung-yeop becomes a shadow of his former self, consumed by hopelessness. But hope is not entirely lost! Seok-hyun and Mu-young, still clinging to a glimmer of optimism, refuse to give up. Can Wudang rise from its ashes and reclaim its former glory? And you, Chung-yeop--pull yourself together already! Stop wallowing and do something, you useless worm!!! ...Wudang Has Fallen!!!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
